~~~~~~~ TRIVIA:

Want to know where 1,080 people live in Harmony every day?

Just travel to Fillmore County, Minnesota, and visit the town of Harmony. It
bills itself as the "Biggest Little Town in Southern Minnesota," and
features the largest Amish population in the state. The town may
occasionally face misunderstandings and disagreements, but it's fair to say
that everyone there lives in Harmony.

